  "description": "Subject: Overview of Current HCPI Registry Entries  \n\nDear Team,\n\nThe registry currently includes two health care provider identifiers. HCPI \u201chcp1\u201d corresponds to **Klinik Musterstadt**, registered under the telematics ID **1\u20111\u20110\u2011123456** with the role of **Hospital**. This entry is linked to the test suite **TestSuiteA** and is associated with two cards: the first card bears the ICCSN **ICCSN\u2011001** and is of type **eGK**, while the second carries the ICCSN **ICCSN\u2011002** and is a patient\u2011authentication card (**ePA**).\n\nThe second identifier, \u201chcp2\u201d, references **Praxis Dr.\u202fSchmidt**, which has the telematics ID **1\u20112\u20110\u2011654321** and is classified as a **Practice**. It is equipped with a single eGK card identified by ICCSN **ICCSN\u2011003**. No specific owner test suite is assigned to this entry.  \n\nPlease let me know if any updates or clarifications are needed."
